msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Access preferred connections from system tray. Enter country or server "
"codes, separated by commas, to quickly connect (e.g.: NL#42, JP, US, IT#01)."
msgstr ""
"Dostopajte do priljubljenih povezav iz sistemske vrstice. Za hitro "
"povezovanje vnesite države ali številke strežnikov, ločene z vejicami (n. "
"pr.: NL#42, JP, US, IT#01)."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Active port is {new_port}"
msgstr "Aktivna vrata {new_port}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Allow selected apps to connect without VPN protection."
msgstr "Dovoli izbranim aplikacijam povezavo brez zaščite VPN."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Beta access has been disabled.\n"
"Please restart the app for changes to take effect."
msgstr ""
"Dostop do beta različice je bil onemogočen.\n"
"Za uveljavitev sprememb ponovno zaženite aplikacijo."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Beta access has been enabled.\n"
"Please restart the app for changes to take effect."
msgstr ""
"Dostop do beta različice je bil omogočen.\n"
"Za uveljavitev sprememb ponovno zaženite aplikacijo."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Bypass firewalls to connect to P2P servers and devices on your local "
"network. "
msgstr ""
"Obidite požarne zidove za povezavo s strežniki P2P in napravami v vašem "
"lokalnem omrežju. "

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Captures a specific issue you're facing when using Proton VPN to get help from our customer support team.\n"
"\n"
"Warning: This file is a recording of all your internet activity during the capture session."
msgstr ""
"Zabeleži konkretno težavo, s katero se soočate pri uporabi Proton VPN, da lahko zaprosite našo ekipo za podporo strankam za pomoč.\n"
"\n"
"Opozorilo: Ta datoteka vsebuje posnetek vse vaše spletne aktivnosti med snemanjem."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Connect to Proton VPN using your own domain name servers (DNS)."
msgstr "Povežite se s Proton VPN s svojim strežnikom domenskih imen (DNS)."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Connect to a Tor server to access hidden services and onion sites using any "
"browser."
msgstr ""
"Povežite se s strežnikom Tor za dostop do skritih storitev in Tor spletnih "
"mest s katerim koli brskalnikom."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Connect to your destination server through a second, maximum security VPN "
"server. Slower, but more private."
msgstr ""
"Connect to your destination server through a second, maximum security VPN "
"server. Slower, but more private."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Copied!"
msgstr "Copied!"

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Crash reports help us fix bugs, detect firewalls, and avoid VPN blocks.\n"
"\n"
"These statistics do not contain your IP address, and they cannot be used to identify you. We'll never share them with third parties."
msgstr ""
"Poročila o zrušitvah nam pomagajo odpraviti napake, zaznati požarne zidove in se izogniti blokiranju VPN.\n"
"\n"
"Ti statistični podatki ne vsebujejo vašega IP naslova in jih ni mogoče uporabiti za identifikacijo uporabnika. Teh informacij nikoli ne delimo s tretjimi osebami."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Customize your connection by deciding which apps are protected by VPN."
msgstr ""
"Prilagodite svojo povezavo tako, da določite, katere aplikacije so zaščitene"
" s storitvijo VPN."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Disables randomization of the local addresses mapping. This can slightly "
"reduce connection security, but should allow direct connections for online "
"gaming and similar purposes."
msgstr ""
"Onemogoči naključno dodeljevanje lokalnih naslovov. To lahko nekoliko "
"zmanjša varnost povezave, vendar naj bi omogočilo neposredne povezave za "
"spletne igre in podobne namene."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Disabling Beta access..."
msgstr "Onemogočanje beta dostopa ..."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Each code can only be used once"
msgstr "Vsaka koda se lahko uporabi samo enkrat"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Enabling Beta access..."
msgstr "Omogočanje beta dostopa ..."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Get early access and help us test new versions of Proton VPN."
msgstr ""
"Zagotovite si zgodnji dostop in nam pomagajte preizkusiti nove različice "
"Proton VPN."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "If your security key has a button or a gold disc, tap it now."
msgstr "Če ima vaš varnostni ključ gumb ali zlati disk, ga zdaj pritisnite."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Increase your connection speed by up to 400% with performance enhancing "
"technologies."
msgstr ""
"Povečajte svojo hitrost povezave do 400 % s tehnologijami za izboljšanje "
"zmogljivosti."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Insert the U2F or FIDO key linked to your Proton Account. "
msgstr "Vstavite ključ U2F ali FIDO, povezan z vašim računom Proton. "

msgctxt "message"
msgid "It was not possible to disable Beta access.\n"
msgstr "Dostopa do beta različice ni bilo mogoče onemogočiti.\n"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "It was not possible to enable Beta access.\n"
msgstr "Dostopa do beta različice ni bilo mogoče omogočiti.\n"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Kill switch is blocking any outgoing connections."
msgstr "Stikalo za izklop blokira vse odhodne povezave."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Kill switch selection is disabled while VPN is active. Disconnect to make "
"changes."
msgstr ""
"Izbiranje odklopnega stikala je onemogočeno, dokler je VPN aktiven. Za "
"spremembo nastavitev najprej prekinite povezavo."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Multiple security keys were found. Tap one to select it."
msgstr ""
"Najdenih je bilo več varnostnih ključev. Dotaknite se enega, da ga izberete."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Only selected apps connect with VPN protection. All other traffic is "
"unprotected."
msgstr ""
"Samo izbrane aplikacije se povežejo z zaščito VPN. Ves ostali promet je "
"nezaščiten."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Permanent Kill Switch is blocking any outgoing connections and preventing your IP to be exposed.\n"
"\n"
"Do you want to disable Kill Switch?"
msgstr ""
"Stalno aktivirano odklopno stikalo blokira vse odhodne povezave in preprečuje razkritje vašega IP-naslova.\n"
"\n"
"Želite izklopiti funkcijo odklopnega stikala?"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Please establish a new VPN connection for changes to take effect."
msgstr "Za uveljavitev sprememb vzpostavite novo VPN povezavo."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Protect yourself from ads, malware, and trackers on websites and apps."
msgstr ""
"Zaščitite se pred oglasi, zlonamerno programsko opremo in sledilniki na "
"spletnih straneh in v aplikacijah."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Protocol can only be changed when VPN is disconnected."
msgstr ""
"Protokol je mogoče spremeniti le, ko je VPN povezava ni vzpostavljena."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Protocol selection is disabled while VPN is active. Disconnect to make "
"changes."
msgstr ""
"Izbiranje protokola je onemogočeno, dokler je VPN aktiven. Za spremembo "
"nastavitev najprej prekinite povezavo."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Quitting the application will cancel the current VPN connection.\n"
"\n"
"Do you want to continue?"
msgstr ""
"Odjava iz aplikacije bo prekinila aktivno VPN povezavo.\n"
"\n"
"Želite nadaljevati?"

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Quitting the application will keep the kill switch active, but your current VPN connection will be terminated.\n"
"\n"
"Do you want to continue?"
msgstr ""
"Če zaprete aplikacijo, bo odklopno stikalo ostalo aktivno, vendar se bo vaša trenutna VPN povezava prekinila.\n"
"\n"
"Želite nadaljevati?"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Reporting your issue..."
msgstr "Prijavljanje težave ..."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Signing in..."
msgstr "Prijavljanje ..."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Signing out will cancel the current VPN connection and disable the kill switch.\n"
"\n"
"Do you want to continue?"
msgstr ""
"Odjava bo prekinila trenutno VPN povezavo in onemogočila odklopno stilako.\n"
"\n"
"Želite nadaljevati?"

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Signing out will cancel the current VPN connection.\n"
"\n"
"Do you want to continue?"
msgstr ""
"Odjava bo prekinila trenutno VPN povezavo.\n"
"\n"
"Želite nadaljevati?"

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Signing out will disable the kill switch, potentially exposing your internet traffic. \n"
"\n"
"Do you want to continue?"
msgstr ""
"Odjava bo onemogočila odklopno stikalo, kar lahko izpostavi vaš internetni promet. \n"
"\n"
"Želite nadaljevati??"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Signing out..."
msgstr "Odjavljanje ..."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Split tunneling enabled. Remember to restart affected apps."
msgstr ""
"Deljeno tuneliranje je vklopljeno. Ne pozabite ponovno zagnati prizadete "
"aplikacije."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"These servers give the best performance for BitTorrent and file sharing."
msgstr ""
"These servers give the best performance for BitTorrent and file sharing."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"This technology allows Proton VPN to provide higher speed and security in "
"difficult-to-reach countries."
msgstr ""
"This technology allows Proton VPN to provide higher speed and security in "
"difficult-to-reach countries."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "This will disable NetShield."
msgstr "To bo onemogočilo NetShield."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "This will disable custom DNS."
msgstr "To bo onemogočilo DNS po meri."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Tunnels IPv6 traffic through the VPN. Can enhance compatibility with IPv6 "
"networks."
msgstr ""
"Tunelira promet IPv6 prek VPN-ja. Lahko izboljša združljivost z omrežji "
"IPv6."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "When enabled, the app starts minimized to the tray."
msgstr ""
"Ko je ta možnost omogočena, se aplikacija zažene v pomanjšana v sistemski "
"vrstici."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"You will be connected to a server as soon as Proton VPN app starts. Replace "
"it with a country ISO code (e.g.: US for United States), a server (e.g.: "
"NL#42) or Fastest for quick connection. Default value: Off."
msgstr ""
"Takoj, ko se aplikacija Proton VPN zažene, boste povezani s strežnikom. To "
"nastavitev lahko zamenjate z ISO kodo države (npr.: US za Združene države "
"Amerike), imenom strežnika (npr.: NL#42) ali z možnostjo »Najhitrejši« za "
"hitro povezavo. Privzeta vrednost: Izklopljeno."

